{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52141","headline":"题中岳山七言（在京南） · 玄奘","name":"题中岳山七言（在京南）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤峰绝顶万余嶒，策杖攀萝渐渐登。\n行到目边天上寺，白云相伴两三僧。\n（以上五首均见斯三七三卷）（按：《题西天舍眼塔》前署「大唐三藏」，应即指玄奘。\n其前抄李存勖诗五首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄奘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}